        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>A Gold Saint stands in the attack, wearing gold, and punches a god.</em></p>\n<p>Eleven days out of thirteen you are an excellent but not dominant martial. On the thirteenth &mdash; the\nday your own constellation rises &mdash; the Cloth burns and you become something else. And on one day in\ntwo hundred and sixty, the sky exalts you, and for that day you are very nearly unstoppable.</p>\n<p>You are not a spellcaster. Your power is your own inner cosmo; the sky only wakes it.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Key Ability</h2>\n<p><strong>Strength or Dexterity.</strong> Your Cosmo DC uses whichever you chose.</p>\n<h2>Hit Points</h2>\n<p><strong>10 plus your Constitution modifier</strong></p>\n<h2>The Three-Tier Curve</h2>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Sky state</th><th>You are</th><th>Effect</th><th>Frequency</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Normal day</td><td>~15% weaker than a comparable martial</td><td>baseline</td><td>~11 days in 13</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Ascendant</strong></td><td>~30% stronger</td><td>Techniques heighten as if <strong>+4 levels</strong></td><td>1 day in 13</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Zenith</strong></td><td>~100% stronger</td><td>Techniques heighten as if <strong>+8 levels</strong></td><td>1 day in 260</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The &minus;15% floor lives in the Strike line: the fist is 1d6 and there is no flurry. The +30% / +100%\nlives in the Techniques and the boons. Defensive and control Cloths pay their multiplier in <em>scope</em>\nrather than dice &mdash; their flat damage line is correct by design.</p>\n<h2>Techniques</h2>\n<p>Techniques have <strong>no rank</strong>. You gain four, at levels <strong>1, 6, 11, and 16</strong>, and\neach heightens once per 2 character levels above the level it was gained. All four converge on 20d6 / 10d8\nby 20th level, so an early Technique never becomes dead weight &mdash; later slots buy new <em>shapes</em>,\nnot bigger numbers.</p>\n<p><strong>Spell-attack Techniques get no potency runes</strong>, so a Technique's attack bonus is 2 lower\nthan your Strike. Say this at the table.</p>\n<h2>Proficiencies</h2>\n<p>At 1st level: Perception trained; Fortitude and Reflex expert, Will trained; Athletics plus three other\nskills trained; unarmed attacks trained (no weapon proficiency); unarmored defense and light and medium\narmor trained; Cosmo DC trained.</p>"
        },
